**
**	Readable body reconstructed from the retail disassembly.  Every structural
**	claim below is cited by the instruction offset in the retail body that
**	proves it; nothing here is guessed.
**
**	- The three `this`-relative reads (m_color@0x1C4, m_observer@0x296,
**	  m_isPlayerDead@0x680) are served by the TU-local layout shim
**	  inputs/reference/shims/playerlocalcolor/Common/Player.h, which reproduces
**	  all 17 BFME-witnessed Player field offsets; m_color by name therefore
**	  emits +0x1C4 and isPlayerActive() emits +0x296/+0x680.
**	- Object, Overridable, Drawable, StealthUpdate, SpecialDisguiseUpdate and
**	  GlobalData have no BFME layout witness, so they are read through
**	  address-named view shims and explicit offsets.
*/

